I like this idea, I can just see it now,
#chat
direction ...
I'll trade you my gauntlets of power for a spellbook of polymorph!

Fred drops a spellbook

You then of course drop you gauntlets and trade places, and then the
guy uses your gauntlets to beat you to a pulp.  Great fun!  :-)

Seriously, I like the idea a lot, but it wouldn't be fair to have
one person who goes down faster to grab everything before the person
above so I think people should only cross paths when they both happen
to be on the same level.  For example, Fred is in the dungeon on level 5
and I go down the staircase from level 4.  It seems to me the bones code
could be adapted for this, and #chat could be extended.


